# Billing and entitlements. Load parity/billing-setup.sql first, then:
#   go run ./cmd/parity -a http://127.0.0.1:8081 -b http://127.0.0.1:18102 -jwt-secret parity-secret \
#     -cases parity/billing.jsonl -ignore requestId,generatedAt
# Both backends without RevenueCat secrets (the shared Vapor has none), so
# restore, management-url and the webhook answer their 503s here; the
# webhook's accepted paths are in parity/billing-webhook.jsonl.
